		(property "Notes" "VBUS flat-clamp TVS. Fitted part: Wuxi Maxinmicro TVS2200DRVR, LCSC C55616459 (2026-10-31; TI C523793 was short at JLC). Same pinout and DFN-6 2x2 body (EP 0.9 x 1.7 vs TI 1.0 x 1.6, inside TI tolerance). Maker sheet: 22 V standoff, 26.1 V, 60 A 8/20 us, 105 pF, 10 nA; no min/max limits given. TI reference values: 24.6 V breakdown min, 28 V clamp at 40 A 8/20 us. Replaces the SMAJ22A (35.5 V clamp; review 4 C-4). Pins 1-3 + EP to GND, 4-6 to VBUS"
